msgstr "Očisti predmemoriju preuzimanja"

msgid "Add a repository / PPA"
msgstr "Dodaj repozitorij / PPA"

msgid "(AUR)"
msgstr "(AUR)"

msgid "Command translator: {family} (Debian, Ubuntu, Mint, Fedora) to pacman and pamac (Arch, BigLinux, Manjaro)"
msgstr "Prevoditelj naredbi: {family} (Debian, Ubuntu, Mint, Fedora) u pacman i pamac (Arch, BigLinux, Manjaro)"

msgid "Both do the same job: install, update and remove programs. Only the commands change."
msgstr "Oboje rade isti posao: instaliraju, ažuriraju i uklanjaju programe. Mijenjaju se samo naredbe."

msgid "You can keep typing {tool} commands: they are translated and run with pamac or pacman."
msgstr "Možete i dalje upisivati naredbe {tool}: prevode se i izvršavaju s pamacom ili pacmanom."

msgid "No command matches “{topic}”."
msgstr "Nijedna naredba ne odgovara “{topic}”."

msgid "Run “{tool} help” to see every command."
msgstr "Pokrenite “{tool} help” da vidite sve naredbe."

msgid "What you want to do"
msgstr "Što želite učiniti"

msgid "Differences that catch people"
msgstr "Razlike koje zbunjuju"

msgid "apt update only refreshes the list; apt upgrade installs."
msgstr "apt update samo osvježava popis; apt upgrade instalira."

msgid "In pacman, -Syu does both together."
msgstr "U pacmanu -Syu radi oboje zajedno."

msgid "Avoid “pacman -Sy” alone: it can break the system."
msgstr "Izbjegavajte samo “pacman -Sy”: može pokvariti sustav."

msgid "Package types"
msgstr "Vrste paketa"

msgid "apt uses .deb files, dnf uses .rpm, pacman uses .pkg.tar.zst."
msgstr "apt koristi .deb datoteke, dnf koristi .rpm, pacman koristi .pkg.tar.zst."

msgid ".deb and .rpm files are converted and installed with big-pkg-installer (or a double click)."
msgstr "Datoteke .deb i .rpm pretvaraju se i instaliraju pomoću big-pkg-installer (ili dvostrukim klikom)."

msgid "Programs from the community"
msgstr "Programi zajednice"

msgid "The AUR plays the role of PPAs and COPR."
msgstr "AUR ima ulogu PPA-ova i COPR-a."

msgid "Use “pamac build <name>”; never run AUR helpers with sudo."
msgstr "Koristite “pamac build <name>”; nikada ne pokrećite AUR pomoćnike sa sudo."

msgid "Tip: “{tool} help install” shows only the lines about one command."
msgstr "Savjet: “{tool} help install” prikazuje samo retke o jednoj naredbi."

msgid "Quick reference: “sudo” is needed to install or remove; searching and listing are not."
msgstr "Brza referenca: “sudo” je potreban za instalaciju ili uklanjanje; pretraživanje i popisivanje ne trebaju ga."

msgid "Command not found: {cmd}"
msgstr "Naredba nije pronađena: {cmd}"

msgid "The package's own scripts only register a software repository and an AppArmor profile for other distributions; they are not needed here."
msgstr "Vlastite skripte paketa samo registriraju repozitorij softvera i AppArmor profil za druge distribucije; ovdje nisu potrebne."

msgid "Unsupported RPM payload format."
msgstr "Nepodržan format RPM sadržaja."

msgid "The file is not an RPM package."
msgstr "Datoteka nije RPM paket."

msgid "This is a source RPM (.src.rpm): it contains source code, not a program to install."
msgstr "Ovo je izvorni RPM (.src.rpm): sadrži izvorni kôd, a ne program za instalaciju."

msgid "The {script} script configures an APT repository; that part has no effect on this system."
msgstr "Skripta {script} podešava APT repozitorij; taj dio nema učinka na ovaj sustav."

msgid "The {script} script is written in Lua for RPM itself and was skipped."
msgstr "Skripta {script} napisana je u Lua za sam RPM i preskočena je."

msgid "The {script} script configures a DNF/YUM repository; that part has no effect on this system."
msgstr "Skripta {script} konfigurira DNF/YUM repozitorij; taj dio nema učinka na ovaj sustav."
